# Development Guidelines

## Code Style
The project uses ESLint and Prettier for code formatting:
- [.prettierrc.mjs](mdc:.prettierrc.mjs) - Prettier configuration
- [eslint.config.js](mdc:eslint.config.js) - ESLint rules

## TypeScript
- All new code should be written in TypeScript
- Type definitions for Astro are included in [src/env.d.ts](mdc:src/env.d.ts)

## Content Management
- Blog posts and work experience entries should be added to their respective directories in `content/`
- Content is typed and validated according to the schema in [src/content.config.ts](mdc:src/content.config.ts)

## Node Version
The project uses a specific Node.js version as defined in [.nvmrc](mdc:.nvmrc)
